WEBVTT

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:07.833
In Content Items, View on the Help Center row opens the list on the site.

00:00:08.289 --> 00:00:12.269
Visitors see the published items as links, the most recent first.

00:00:12.269 --> 00:00:15.129
The draft is not there until it is published.

00:00:15.588 --> 00:00:19.142
Selecting a title opens the item on a page of its own.

00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:23.408
Each item of the list has its own address, like any other content.

